{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣網上節目《Fighting時間》近期推出全新整人企劃，安排假網約「狂迷司機」對着啦啦隊女神林襄狂傾個人私密內容，沒想到影片曝光後引發強烈反響。</p><p>不少網民質疑，製作團隊竟將女性日常生活中可能面臨的安全威脅當成娛樂效果，批評聲浪迅速擴大。</p><p>對此</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:22:00.006275+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T18:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:15:10.578366+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:15:10.578366+00:00","content_hash":"b84d94d51b831b135fa77c7eb5268a7701c3c07d751e73f3766321f832ffcb43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}